# CodeGraph index data, local to each machine. This rule has to live here rather
# than in .codegraph/.gitignore: eas-cli collects nested ignore files with
# fast-glob and never passes dot: true, so it never sees a rule inside a dot
# directory, and its build upload chokes on daemon.sock.
.codegraph/
